Enabling Display Manager

For both x86_64 and i686

sudo systemctl enable gdm
sudo systemctl start gdm

For i386,i486,i586 (Mac (PowerPC) and IBM-PPC (POWER5),SPARC,HP PA-RISC,IA-64
sudo apt-get install ubuntu-desktop gnome-session gnome-panel gnome-terminal gdm
sudo reboot
